-- חוזר לבעלויות תשע"ד/8 — קצובת ביגוד לשנת הלימודים תשע"ד
-- The clothing allowance for school year תשע"ד: in the upper division at
-- level 4 (2116); outside it reduced to 84% of level 3 or level 4 by
-- seniority, with pension-related payments computed on the full level 4;
-- the additional physical-education allowance by position size; and the
-- shoes-and-coats allowance in technological education.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT property_checks

-- not weighed against `the Hours of Work and Rest Law`: the clothing
-- allowance is paid pro rata to the position, up to one full position, and
-- the cap of 140% of a position across all employers restates the
-- agreements' limit on employment beyond a full position. A cap takes away
-- no rest and adds no hour; the weeks the agreements allow beyond a full
-- position are weighed where they set them (the takanon's §1.24, the base
-- agreement's §33, the Oz agreement's §14).

§ `חוזר תשע"ד/8 קצובת ביגוד תשע"ד`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead and the circular's title; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p6 akn:preamble/p7 akn:preamble/p8 akn:preamble/p9 The table of contents: the titles of sections 1 to 4.

@desc A teaching employee's school year תשע"ד as the clothing allowance asks about it.
DECLARE `clothing year of circular תשע"ד/8` HAS
    `graded as a teaching employee`  IS A BOOLEAN @desc graded in the teaching-employees grading
    `employed by a supervised owner` IS A BOOLEAN @desc employed by an owner of education supervised by the Ministry of Education
    `stage`                          IS A `stage of education`
    `positions`                      IS A LIST OF NUMBER @desc the position held with each employer (1 = a full position)
    `seniority years`                IS A NUMBER  @desc teaching seniority in years
    `teaches physical education`     IS A BOOLEAN
    `physical-education position`    IS A NUMBER
    `technological subjects`         IS A LIST OF STRING @desc the subjects taught in technological education, as the lists print them; empty for none
    `level-3 allowance`              IS A NUMBER @desc the level-3 amount under the Accountant General's instructions; not printed in this circular, so an input

DECLARE `tashad-8 clothing action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the clothing allowance in circular תשע"ד/8` HAS `clothing paid` IS A NUMBER
    `pay the additional clothing allowances in circular תשע"ד/8` HAS `amount of the additional allowances paid` IS A NUMBER
    `employ above the cap in circular תשע"ד/8` HAS `position employed` IS A NUMBER

GIVEN y IS A `clothing year of circular תשע"ד/8`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the upper division` y IF
    y's `stage` EQUALS `the upper-division stage` OR y's `stage` EQUALS `the grades 13-14 stage`

GIVEN y IS A `clothing year of circular תשע"ד/8`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the position share capped at one` y IS
    min (sum (y's `positions`)) 1

GIVEN y IS A `clothing year of circular תשע"ד/8`, `the allowance` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `what all employers pay, each its own share` y `the allowance` IS
    sum (map (GIVEN p YIELD `the allowance` TIMES p) (y's `positions`))

GIVEN y IS A `clothing year of circular תשע"ד/8`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `employed by more than one employer above a full position in circular תשע"ד/8` y IF
        count (y's `positions`) GREATER THAN 1
    AND sum (y's `positions`) GREATER THAN 1

DECLARE `terms of employment of circular תשע"ד/8` IS ONE OF
    `not under a reform in circular תשע"ד/8`
    `Oz LeTmura, partial implementation in circular תשע"ד/8`
    `Oz LeTmura, full implementation in circular תשע"ד/8`
    `Ofek Hadash in circular תשע"ד/8`

GIVEN cap IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tashad-8 clothing action`
DECIDE `no employment above` cap IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    SHANT `employ above the cap in circular תשע"ד/8` p PROVIDED p GREATER THAN cap
    LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "circular תשע\"ד/8, 1.א.6 and 2.א.6: no employment above the position cap with all employers"

§§ `1. בחטיבה העליונה`

-- akn:art_1/p1 The heading "תחולה"; no rule.
-- akn:art_1/p3 Says the rules below follow the Treasury's instructions; they are the clauses that follow.
-- akn:art_1__para_a Heading 1.א ("כללי"); no rule of its own.

@ref akn:art_1/p2
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year of circular תשע"ד/8`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 1 of circular תשע"ד/8 applies to` y IF
        y's `graded as a teaching employee`
    AND y's `employed by a supervised owner`
    AND `in the upper division` y

-- 1.א.2: an employee in the teaching grading is entitled to the clothing
-- allowance as public-facing civil-service workers are, for school year
-- תשע"ד (09/13-08/14); the `clothing year of circular תשע"ד/8` is that year.
@ref akn:art_1__para_a__subpara_2
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year of circular תשע"ד/8`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the clothing allowance for תשע"ד` y IF
    y's `graded as a teaching employee`

-- 1.א.3: in the upper division, by level 4, that is 2116.
@ref akn:art_1__para_a__subpara_3
`the level-4 allowance of circular תשע"ד/8` MEANS 2116

-- 1.א.4: pro-rated, no more than one position. 1.א.5: with more than one
-- employer and above 100%, each employer pays its own share.
@ref akn:art_1__para_a__subpara_4 akn:art_1__para_a__subpara_5
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year of circular תשע"ד/8`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the upper-division allowance` y IS
    IF `employed by more than one employer above a full position in circular תשע"ד/8` y
    THEN `what all employers pay, each its own share` y `the level-4 allowance of circular תשע"ד/8`
    ELSE `the level-4 allowance of circular תשע"ד/8` TIMES `the position share capped at one` y

-- 1.א.6: a teaching employee is restricted to 140% with all employers;
-- under Oz LeTmura to 128% in partial and 125% in full implementation.
-- ¶2 ties these sizes to "the conditions required for approval to work at
-- them": partial implementation's 128% is the bound with approval, as
-- circular תשע"ד/2 (section 15) sets it beside a 117% maximum without — the
-- same case, not a contradiction.
@ref akn:art_1__para_a__subpara_6
GIVEN t IS A `terms of employment of circular תשע"ד/8`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the cap with all employers under 1.א.6` t IS
    CONSIDER t
    WHEN `Oz LeTmura, partial implementation in circular תשע"ד/8` THEN 128%
    WHEN `Oz LeTmura, full implementation in circular תשע"ד/8`    THEN 125%
    OTHERWISE 140%

-- 1.א.6 ¶2: what is said above changes nothing in the conditions for
-- approval to work at these sizes, and is no permit to employ beyond them.
@ref akn:art_1__para_a__subpara_6/p2
GIVEN t IS A `terms of employment of circular תשע"ד/8`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tashad-8 clothing action`
DECIDE `no employment above the cap under 1.א.6` t IS
    `no employment above` (`the cap with all employers under 1.א.6` t)

§§ `2. שלא בחטיבה העליונה`

-- akn:art_2/p1 Background: the participation law of 1.7.2013 and the agreement of 22.7.2013; the rules it brings are 2.א.
-- akn:art_2/p2 The heading "תחולה"; no rule.
-- akn:art_2__para_a Heading 2.א ("כללי"); no rule of its own.

-- ¶3 names "גני ילדים, יסודי, חט"ב, וסמינרים / מכללות להכשרת עו"ה": the
-- shared `stage of education`'s kindergarten, primary and junior-high
-- stages and its colleges, the academic college among them.
@ref akn:art_2/p3
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year of circular תשע"ד/8`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `section 2 applies to` y IF
        y's `graded as a teaching employee`
    AND y's `employed by a supervised owner`
    AND elem (y's `stage`) (LIST `the kindergarten stage`, `the primary stage`, `the junior-high stage`, `the teachers' college stage`, `the academic teachers' college stage`)

-- 2.א.3, as worded: by section 6 of the agreement of 22.7.2013, in
-- תשע"ד up to 25 years inclusive 84% of level 3; above 25, 84% of level 4.
@ref akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_3 akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_3/p2 akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_3/p3
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year of circular תשע"ד/8`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the reduced allowance as worded` y IS
    IF y's `seniority years` AT MOST 25
    THEN 84% TIMES y's `level-3 allowance`
    ELSE 84% TIMES `the level-4 allowance of circular תשע"ד/8`

`the reduction rate of circular תשע"ד/8` MEANS 84%

-- ¶4 and the table "for convenience", as printed: "1-25 שנים" 1,273 and
-- "26 שנים ומעלה" 1,777 (999 stands for "ומעלה").
@ref akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_3/p4 akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_3/t1
DECLARE `seniority band of circular תשע"ד/8` HAS
    `band from years` IS A NUMBER
    `band to years`   IS A NUMBER
    `band allowance`  IS A NUMBER

`the summary table of circular תשע"ד/8` MEANS
    LIST `seniority band of circular תשע"ד/8` 1  25  1273,
         `seniority band of circular תשע"ד/8` 26 999 1777

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the amounts the summary table gives for` n IS
    map (GIVEN b YIELD b's `band allowance`)
        (filter (GIVEN b YIELD n AT LEAST b's `band from years` AND n AT MOST b's `band to years`)
                `the summary table of circular תשע"ד/8`)

-- The table's level-4 row is 84% of 2116 to the shekel.
#ASSERT TRUNC (`the reduction rate of circular תשע"ד/8` TIMES `the level-4 allowance of circular תשע"ד/8`) 0 EQUALS 1777

-- F-2013-14_tashad_08-c: the clause draws the line at "above 25" and puts
-- every seniority up to 25 at level 3; the table starts at 1 and jumps from
-- 25 to 26. A seniority of 25.5 years, and one under a year, has an amount
-- under the clause and no row in the table.
`the table has no row where the clause has an amount` MEANS
        `the amounts the summary table gives for` 25.5 EQUALS EMPTY
    AND `the amounts the summary table gives for` 0.5 EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `the table has no row where the clause has an amount`

-- The reading adopted: the clause governs; the table is "לצורך הנוחות" and
-- its whole-year rows agree with the clause wherever they apply.
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year of circular תשע"ד/8`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the reduced allowance of circular תשע"ד/8` y IS
    IF y's `seniority years` AT MOST 25 THEN 1273 ELSE 1777

-- ¶5 and 2.א.3.1-2.א.3.4: the pension-related payments are computed as if
-- the full level-4 allowance, 2116, had been paid.
DECLARE `kind of payment of circular תשע"ד/8` IS ONE OF
    @ref akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_3__cls_1
    `contribution to a pension provident fund in circular תשע"ד/8`
    @ref akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_3__cls_2
    `budgetary pension in circular תשע"ד/8`
    @ref akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_3__cls_3
    `one-time payment on termination`
    @ref akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_3__cls_4
    `bridging pension in circular תשע"ד/8`
    `the allowance itself`

@ref akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_3/p5
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year of circular תשע"ד/8`, k IS A `kind of payment of circular תשע"ד/8`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the clothing amount the payment is computed of circular תשע"ד/8 on` y k IS
    IF k EQUALS `the allowance itself` THEN `the reduced allowance of circular תשע"ד/8` y ELSE `the level-4 allowance of circular תשע"ד/8`

-- 2.א.4: pro-rated, no more than one position; 2.א.5: more than one
-- employer above 100%, each pays its own share.
@ref akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_4 akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_5
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year of circular תשע"ד/8`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the allowance outside the upper division` y IS
    IF `employed by more than one employer above a full position in circular תשע"ד/8` y
    THEN `what all employers pay, each its own share` y (`the reduced allowance of circular תשע"ד/8` y)
    ELSE `the reduced allowance of circular תשע"ד/8` y TIMES `the position share capped at one` y

-- F-2013-14_tashad_08-a: in both sections the "no more than one position"
-- clause and the "each employer its own share" clause give different
-- totals for two employers above a full position.
`seventy and sixty percent with two employers of circular תשע"ד/8` MEANS
    `clothing year of circular תשע"ד/8` WITH
        `graded as a teaching employee`  IS TRUE
        `employed by a supervised owner` IS TRUE
        `stage`                          IS `the upper-division stage`
        `positions`                      IS LIST 0.7, 0.6
        `seniority years`                IS 10
        `teaches physical education`     IS FALSE
        `physical-education position`    IS 0
        `technological subjects`         IS EMPTY
        `level-3 allowance`              IS 1500

`one position and each its own share give different allowances for two employers above a full position` MEANS
    NOT (`what all employers pay, each its own share` `seventy and sixty percent with two employers of circular תשע"ד/8` `the level-4 allowance of circular תשע"ד/8`
         EQUALS `the level-4 allowance of circular תשע"ד/8` TIMES `the position share capped at one` `seventy and sixty percent with two employers of circular תשע"ד/8`)
#ASSERT `one position and each its own share give different allowances for two employers above a full position`

-- 2.א.6: 140% with all employers, Ofek Hadash 116.67%; no change to the
-- approval conditions, no permit to employ beyond them.
@ref akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_6
GIVEN t IS A `terms of employment of circular תשע"ד/8`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the cap with all employers under 2.א.6` t IS
    CONSIDER t
    WHEN `Ofek Hadash in circular תשע"ד/8` THEN 116.67%
    OTHERWISE 140%

GIVEN t IS A `terms of employment of circular תשע"ד/8`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tashad-8 clothing action`
DECIDE `no employment above the cap under 2.א.6` t IS
    `no employment above` (`the cap with all employers under 2.א.6` t)

-- ¶6: the reduction applies only to the general clothing allowance, not to
-- the physical-education or the technological allowance.
DECLARE `clothing allowance of circular תשע"ד/8` IS ONE OF
    `the general clothing allowance of circular תשע"ד/8`
    `the physical-education clothing allowance`
    `the technological clothing allowance`

@ref akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_3/p6
GIVEN a IS A `clothing allowance of circular תשע"ד/8`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the reduction applies to` a IF
    a EQUALS `the general clothing allowance of circular תשע"ד/8`

-- 2.א.2: as 1.א.2, for an employee outside the upper division.
@ref akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_2
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year of circular תשע"ד/8`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to the clothing allowance for תשע"ד outside the upper division` y IF
    y's `graded as a teaching employee`

-- 1.א.1 and 2.א.1: the (general) allowance is paid, in full, with the
-- salary of July 2014 (school month 11). Sections 3 and 4 name no month
-- (F-2013-14_tashad_08-f). The reading adopted, by convention
-- dates.no-deadline (conventions.toml): July binds the general allowance;
-- the additional allowances of sections 3 and 4 are owed with no deadline,
-- since no stated time is no deadline.
@ref akn:art_1__para_a__subpara_1 akn:art_2__para_a__subpara_1
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year of circular תשע"ד/8`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tashad-8 clothing action`
DECIDE `the clothing allowance paid with July's salary of circular תשע"ד/8` y IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the clothing allowance in circular תשע"ד/8` amount
          PROVIDED amount AT LEAST `general clothing allowance of circular תשע"ד/8` y
    WITHIN `month number` July
    LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "circular תשע\"ד/8, 1.א.1 and 2.א.1: the clothing allowance is paid with the salary of July 2014"

@ref akn:art_3/p1 akn:art_4__para_4-2
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year of circular תשע"ד/8`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tashad-8 clothing action`
DECIDE `paying the additional allowances of circular תשע"ד/8` y IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the additional clothing allowances in circular תשע"ד/8` `additional amount`
          PROVIDED `additional amount` AT LEAST `physical-education allowance of circular תשע"ד/8` y PLUS `technological clothing allowance of circular תשע"ד/8` y
    LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "sections 3 and 4 name no month: the additional allowances are owed with no deadline"

GIVEN y IS A `clothing year of circular תשע"ד/8`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `general clothing allowance of circular תשע"ד/8` y IS
    BRANCH IF `section 1 of circular תשע"ד/8 applies to` y AND `entitled to the clothing allowance for תשע"ד` y
           THEN `the upper-division allowance` y
           IF `section 2 applies to` y AND `entitled to the clothing allowance for תשע"ד outside the upper division` y
           THEN `the allowance outside the upper division` y
           OTHERWISE 0

§§ `3. חינוך גופני`

-- In addition to the general allowance, sun protection included; the
-- table as printed (999 = "ומעלה").
@ref akn:art_3/p1 akn:art_3/t1
`the physical-education table of circular תשע"ד/8` MEANS
    LIST `physical-education band` 0 TRUE 0.3 TRUE 0,
         `physical-education band` 0.3 TRUE 0.5 TRUE 676,
         `physical-education band` 0.5 TRUE 999 TRUE 1347

-- The rows as printed, each bound inclusive, only to show where they meet
-- (thresholds.shared-bound): no operative rule reads this list; the rule
-- that answers gives a shared bound to the row that opens at it.
GIVEN p IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the amounts the table gives for position of circular תשע"ד/8` p IS
    map (GIVEN b YIELD b's `band amount`)
        (filter (GIVEN b YIELD `the physical-education band takes` p b)
                `the physical-education table of circular תשע"ד/8`)

-- F-2013-14_tashad_08-b: 0.3 and 0.5 fall in two rows each.
`the table gives 0.3 and 0.5 two amounts each in circular תשע"ד/8` MEANS
        `the amounts the table gives for position of circular תשע"ד/8` 0.3 EQUALS LIST 0, 676
    AND `the amounts the table gives for position of circular תשע"ד/8` 0.5 EQUALS LIST 676, 1347
#ASSERT `the table gives 0.3 and 0.5 two amounts each in circular תשע"ד/8`

-- The reading adopted: a row governs from the position it opens at.
GIVEN p IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the physical-education amount of circular תשע"ד/8` p IS
    BRANCH IF p `has reached the row from` 0.5 THEN 1347
           IF p `has reached the row from` 0.3 THEN 676
           OTHERWISE 0

#ASSERT all (GIVEN p YIELD `the amounts the table gives for position of circular תשע"ד/8` p EQUALS LIST (`the physical-education amount of circular תשע"ד/8` p))
            (LIST 0, 0.1, 0.29, 0.31, 0.4, 0.49, 0.51, 0.8, 1)

-- F-2013-14_tashad_08-e: "שיעור העסקה" is not said to be the share of the
-- position in physical education or the employee's whole position. The
-- reading adopted, as F-2011-12_tashab_08-c and its siblings read the same
-- words: the share in physical education, the input
-- `physical-education position`.
`the two readings of the employment rate differ in circular תשע"ד/8` MEANS
    NOT (`the amounts the table gives for position of circular תשע"ד/8` 0.2
         EQUALS `the amounts the table gives for position of circular תשע"ד/8` 1)
#ASSERT `the two readings of the employment rate differ in circular תשע"ד/8`

GIVEN y IS A `clothing year of circular תשע"ד/8`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `physical-education allowance of circular תשע"ד/8` y IS
    IF (`section 1 of circular תשע"ד/8 applies to` y OR `section 2 applies to` y) AND y's `teaches physical education`
    THEN `the physical-education amount of circular תשע"ד/8` (y's `physical-education position`)
    ELSE 0

§§ `4. חינוך טכנולוגי`

-- 4.א: a pair of shoes and two coats a year, worth 557, in these subjects.
DECLARE `shoes-and-coats subject` IS ONE OF
    @ref akn:art_4__para_a__subpara_1
    `מערכות תעופה`
    @ref akn:art_4__para_a__subpara_2
    `מכטרוניקה`
    @ref akn:art_4__para_a__subpara_3
    `טרמודינמיקה טכנית ימית`
    @ref akn:art_4__para_a__subpara_4
    `מערכות סיב"מ ותיב"מ`
    @ref akn:art_4__para_a__subpara_5
    `תחזוקת מערכות מכניות`
    @ref akn:art_4__para_a__subpara_6
    `מערכות מכונאות רכב`
    @ref akn:art_4__para_a__subpara_7
    `מערכות ממוחשבות ברכב`
    @ref akn:art_4__para_a__subpara_8
    `מערכות הספק, פיקוד ובקרה`
    @ref akn:art_4__para_a__subpara_9
    `מערכות בקרת אקלים`
    @ref akn:art_4__para_a__subpara_10
    `אמנות הבישול והאפיה המלונאית`
    @ref akn:art_4__para_a__subpara_11
    `ימאות – ספינות`
    @ref akn:art_4__para_a__subpara_12
    `מערכות טלוויזיה וקולנוע`
    @ref akn:art_4__para_a__subpara_13
    `מערכות צילום`

-- 4.א: the clothing allowance in technological education is paid by the
-- list of subjects; ¶2: a teaching employee / professional instructor in
-- one of them is entitled every year to a pair of shoes and two coats.
@ref akn:art_4__para_a akn:art_4__para_a/p2
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year of circular תשע"ד/8`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to a pair of shoes and two coats` y IF
    any (GIVEN t YIELD elem t `the shoes-and-coats subjects of circular תשע"ד/8`) (y's `technological subjects`)

`the shoes-and-coats subjects of circular תשע"ד/8` MEANS
    LIST "מערכות תעופה", "מכטרוניקה", "טרמודינמיקה טכנית ימית", "מערכות סיב\"מ ותיב\"מ",
         "תחזוקת מערכות מכניות", "מערכות מכונאות רכב", "מערכות ממוחשבות ברכב",
         "מערכות הספק, פיקוד ובקרה", "מערכות בקרת אקלים", "אמנות הבישול והאפיה המלונאית",
         "ימאות – ספינות", "מערכות טלוויזיה וקולנוע", "מערכות צילום"

@ref akn:art_4__para_a/p3
`the value of a pair of shoes and two coats of circular תשע"ד/8` MEANS 557

-- 4.ב: two coats a year, worth 346, in these subjects.
DECLARE `two-coats subject` IS ONE OF
    @ref akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_1
    `מערכות אלקטרוניות`
    @ref akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_2
    `מערכות מחשוב ובקרה`
    @ref akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_3
    `מערכות מחשבים`
    @ref akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_4
    `תכנון ותכנות מערכות`
    @ref akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_5
    `מערכות ביוטכנולוגיה`
    @ref akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_6
    `ניהול תיירותי`
    @ref akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_7
    `ניהול מלונאי`
    @ref akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_8
    `חינוך לגיל הרך`
    @ref akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_9
    `עיצוב`
    @ref akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_10
    `אופנה ותלבושות`
    @ref akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_11
    `עיצוב שיער וטיפוח החן`
    @ref akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_12
    `סיעוד`
    @ref akn:art_4__para_b__subpara_13
    `אמנות שימושית`

-- 4.ב: in one of these subjects, two coats a year.
@ref akn:art_4__para_b
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year of circular תשע"ד/8`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `entitled to two coats` y IF
    any (GIVEN t YIELD elem t `the two-coats subjects of circular תשע"ד/8`) (y's `technological subjects`)

`the two-coats subjects of circular תשע"ד/8` MEANS
    LIST "מערכות אלקטרוניות", "מערכות מחשוב ובקרה", "מערכות מחשבים", "תכנון ותכנות מערכות",
         "מערכות ביוטכנולוגיה", "ניהול תיירותי", "ניהול מלונאי", "חינוך לגיל הרך", "עיצוב",
         "אופנה ותלבושות", "עיצוב שיער וטיפוח החן", "סיעוד", "אמנות שימושית"

@ref akn:art_4__para_b/p2
`the value of two coats of circular תשע"ד/8` MEANS 346

-- 4.2: in addition to the general allowance; 4.3: pro-rated, no more than
-- one position.
-- F-2013-14_tashad_08-d: a teacher of subjects on both lists meets 4.א and
-- 4.ב. The reading adopted, as F-2011-12_tashab_13-c and its siblings read
-- the same words: the larger grant, which holds the two coats the other
-- grants.
@ref akn:art_4__para_4-2 akn:art_4__para_4-3
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year of circular תשע"ד/8`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `technological clothing allowance of circular תשע"ד/8` y IS
    IF NOT (`section 1 of circular תשע"ד/8 applies to` y OR `section 2 applies to` y)
    THEN 0
    ELSE BRANCH IF `entitled to a pair of shoes and two coats` y
                THEN `the value of a pair of shoes and two coats of circular תשע"ד/8` TIMES `the position share capped at one` y
                IF `entitled to two coats` y
                THEN `the value of two coats of circular תשע"ד/8` TIMES `the position share capped at one` y
                OTHERWISE 0

-- akn:conclusions The contact line and the signature; no rule.

§§ `Worked examples`

-- The employees are illustrations, the level-3 amount a placeholder.
`a full-time primary teacher with 30 years` MEANS
    `clothing year of circular תשע"ד/8` WITH
        `graded as a teaching employee`  IS TRUE
        `employed by a supervised owner` IS TRUE
        `stage`                          IS `the primary stage`
        `positions`                      IS LIST 1
        `seniority years`                IS 30
        `teaches physical education`     IS TRUE
        `physical-education position`    IS 0.5
        `technological subjects`         IS EMPTY
        `level-3 allowance`              IS 1500

#ASSERT `general clothing allowance of circular תשע"ד/8` `a full-time primary teacher with 30 years` EQUALS 1777
#ASSERT `physical-education allowance of circular תשע"ד/8` `a full-time primary teacher with 30 years` EQUALS 1347
#ASSERT `the clothing amount the payment is computed of circular תשע"ד/8 on` `a full-time primary teacher with 30 years` `budgetary pension in circular תשע"ד/8` EQUALS 2116
#ASSERT `general clothing allowance of circular תשע"ד/8` `seventy and sixty percent with two employers of circular תשע"ד/8` EQUALS 2750.8
#EVAL   `the reduced allowance as worded` `a full-time primary teacher with 30 years`

#TRACE `the clothing allowance paid with July's salary of circular תשע"ד/8` `a full-time primary teacher with 30 years` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the clothing allowance in circular תשע"ד/8` 3124 AT 11
#TRACE `no employment above the cap under 2.א.6` `Ofek Hadash in circular תשע"ד/8` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `employ above the cap in circular תשע"ד/8` 1.2 AT 2

-- F-2013-14_tashad_08-g: the table bands "שיעור העסקה" without saying whether a teacher
-- with more than one employer is banded per employer or across them; per
-- employer, two at 40% each pay more than one at 80%. The reading adopted,
-- as F-2021-22_tashpab_07-b's: each employer applies the table to the
-- position it employs.
`two employers at 40% each pay more than one employer at 80% in circular תשע"ד/8` MEANS
    `the physical-education amount of circular תשע"ד/8` 0.4 PLUS `the physical-education amount of circular תשע"ד/8` 0.4
        GREATER THAN `the physical-education amount of circular תשע"ד/8` 0.8
#ASSERT `two employers at 40% each pay more than one employer at 80% in circular תשע"ד/8`

§§ `Property checks`

-- The circular over a finite space: every stage, one employer at positions
-- in tenths from 0 to 1.5 or two at every pair in fifths to 1, seniority
-- 0 to 40 with 25.5, physical-education shares in tenths, every subject of
-- either list, none, a subject on neither and one of each list, in the
-- grade or not.

`every stage of circular תשע"ד/8` MEANS
    LIST `the upper-division stage`, `the grades 13-14 stage`, `the kindergarten stage`, `the primary stage`, `the junior-high stage`, `the teachers' college stage`
`seniority checked of circular תשע"ד/8` MEANS LIST 0, 1, 10, 25, 25.5, 26, 40
`every subject list checked of circular תשע"ד/8` MEANS
    append (LIST EMPTY, (LIST "מכטרוניקה", "מערכות אלקטרוניות"), (LIST "נושא אחר"))
           (map (GIVEN t YIELD LIST t) (append `the shoes-and-coats subjects of circular תשע"ד/8` `the two-coats subjects of circular תשע"ד/8`))

GIVEN g IS A BOOLEAN
      st IS A `stage of education`
      ps IS A LIST OF NUMBER
      n IS A NUMBER
      e IS A BOOLEAN
      r IS A NUMBER
      l IS A LIST OF STRING
GIVETH A `clothing year of circular תשע"ד/8`
DECIDE `a checked year of circular תשע"ד/8` g st ps n e r l IS
    `clothing year of circular תשע"ד/8` WITH
        `graded as a teaching employee`  IS g
        `employed by a supervised owner` IS TRUE
        `stage`                          IS st
        `positions`                      IS ps
        `seniority years`                IS n
        `teaches physical education`     IS e
        `physical-education position`    IS r
        `technological subjects`         IS l
        `level-3 allowance`              IS 1500

-- Sections 1 and 2 over every stage, grade, seniority and position: exactly
-- one section applies to an employee of the grading, the general allowance
-- is level 4 pro-rated in the upper division and the reduced amount
-- pro-rated outside it, never negative, never falling with a larger
-- position, above one paying as one.
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year of circular תשע"ד/8`
      g IS A BOOLEAN
      st IS A `stage of education`
      p IS A NUMBER
      n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `sections 1 and 2 of circular תשע"ד/8 hold for` y g st p n IF
    LET a MEANS `general clothing allowance of circular תשע"ד/8` y
        full MEANS IF `in the upper division` y THEN `the level-4 allowance of circular תשע"ד/8` ELSE `the reduced allowance of circular תשע"ד/8` y
    IN      count (filter (GIVEN b YIELD b) (LIST `section 1 of circular תשע"ד/8 applies to` y, `section 2 applies to` y)) EQUALS (IF g THEN 1 ELSE 0)
        AND a EQUALS (IF g THEN full TIMES min p 1 ELSE 0)
        AND a AT LEAST 0
        AND a AT MOST `general clothing allowance of circular תשע"ד/8` (`a checked year of circular תשע"ד/8` g st (LIST (p PLUS 0.1)) n FALSE 0 EMPTY)

#ASSERT all (GIVEN g YIELD
                all (GIVEN st YIELD
                        all (GIVEN p YIELD
                                all (GIVEN n YIELD
                                        `sections 1 and 2 of circular תשע"ד/8 hold for` (`a checked year of circular תשע"ד/8` g st (LIST p) n FALSE 0 EMPTY) g st p n)
                                    `seniority checked of circular תשע"ד/8`)
                            `tenths to 1.5`)
                    `every stage of circular תשע"ד/8`)
            `both booleans`

-- 2.א.3 over seniority: the reduced allowance never falls with seniority,
-- and every whole year from 1 has exactly the row the clause gives it.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN n YIELD
                    `the reduced allowance of circular תשע"ד/8` (`a checked year of circular תשע"ד/8` TRUE `the primary stage` (LIST 1) n FALSE 0 EMPTY)
                    AT MOST `the reduced allowance of circular תשע"ד/8` (`a checked year of circular תשע"ד/8` TRUE `the primary stage` (LIST 1) (n PLUS 1) FALSE 0 EMPTY)
                AND `the amounts the summary table gives for` n
                    EQUALS LIST (`the reduced allowance of circular תשע"ד/8` (`a checked year of circular תשע"ד/8` TRUE `the primary stage` (LIST 1) n FALSE 0 EMPTY)))
            (range 1 45)

-- 1.א.5 and 2.א.5 with two employers over every pair in fifths: each pays
-- its own share, together more than one position's allowance exactly where
-- the positions add to more than one (F-2013-14_tashad_08-a, whole space).
#ASSERT all (GIVEN p YIELD
                all (GIVEN q YIELD
                        LET y MEANS `a checked year of circular תשע"ד/8` TRUE `the upper-division stage` (LIST p, q) 10 FALSE 0 EMPTY
                        IN  (`general clothing allowance of circular תשע"ד/8` y GREATER THAN `the level-4 allowance of circular תשע"ד/8`) EQUALS (p PLUS q GREATER THAN 1))
                    `fifths to 1`)
            `fifths to 1`

-- Section 3 over shares in tenths: every share is in some row, two exactly
-- at 0.3 and 0.5 (F-2013-14_tashad_08-b, whole space), the amount is one of
-- those rows', it never falls, and outside the grade it is nothing.
-- F-2013-14_tashad_08-e over the same shares: the two readings part for a
-- full-position teacher exactly below 0.5.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN r YIELD
                LET rows MEANS `the amounts the table gives for position of circular תשע"ד/8` r
                    a MEANS `physical-education allowance of circular תשע"ד/8` (`a checked year of circular תשע"ד/8` TRUE `the primary stage` (LIST 1) 10 TRUE r EMPTY)
                IN      count rows AT LEAST 1
                    AND (count rows EQUALS 2) EQUALS (r EQUALS 0.3 OR r EQUALS 0.5)
                    AND elem a rows
                    AND a AT MOST `physical-education allowance of circular תשע"ד/8` (`a checked year of circular תשע"ד/8` TRUE `the primary stage` (LIST 1) 10 TRUE (r PLUS 0.1) EMPTY)
                    AND `physical-education allowance of circular תשע"ד/8` (`a checked year of circular תשע"ד/8` FALSE `the primary stage` (LIST 1) 10 TRUE r EMPTY) EQUALS 0
                    AND (NOT (a EQUALS `physical-education allowance of circular תשע"ד/8` (`a checked year of circular תשע"ד/8` TRUE `the primary stage` (LIST 1) 10 TRUE 1 EMPTY)))
                        EQUALS (r LESS THAN 0.5))
            `tenths to 1.5`

-- ¶6: the reduction touches only the general allowance.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN a YIELD `the reduction applies to` a EQUALS (a EQUALS `the general clothing allowance of circular תשע"ד/8`))
            (LIST `the general clothing allowance of circular תשע"ד/8`, `the physical-education clothing allowance`, `the technological clothing allowance`)

-- Section 4 over every subject list and position: never negative, never
-- above the larger grant, falling neither with a larger position nor
-- outside the reduced stages; F-2013-14_tashad_08-d: the two readings part
-- exactly for a teacher on both lists.
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year of circular תשע"ד/8`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `both grants added of circular תשע"ד/8` y IS
    (IF `entitled to a pair of shoes and two coats` y THEN `the value of a pair of shoes and two coats of circular תשע"ד/8` ELSE 0)
    PLUS (IF `entitled to two coats` y THEN `the value of two coats of circular תשע"ד/8` ELSE 0)

#ASSERT all (GIVEN l YIELD
                all (GIVEN p YIELD
                        LET y MEANS `a checked year of circular תשע"ד/8` TRUE `the primary stage` (LIST p) 10 FALSE 0 l
                            t MEANS `technological clothing allowance of circular תשע"ד/8` y
                        IN      t AT LEAST 0
                            AND t AT MOST `the value of a pair of shoes and two coats of circular תשע"ד/8`
                            AND t AT MOST `technological clothing allowance of circular תשע"ד/8` (`a checked year of circular תשע"ד/8` TRUE `the primary stage` (LIST (p PLUS 0.1)) 10 FALSE 0 l)
                            AND t EQUALS `technological clothing allowance of circular תשע"ד/8` (`a checked year of circular תשע"ד/8` TRUE `the upper-division stage` (LIST p) 10 FALSE 0 l))
                    `tenths to 1.5`)
            `every subject list checked of circular תשע"ד/8`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN l YIELD
                LET y MEANS `a checked year of circular תשע"ד/8` TRUE `the upper-division stage` (LIST 1) 10 FALSE 0 l
                IN  (NOT (`both grants added of circular תשע"ד/8` y EQUALS `technological clothing allowance of circular תשע"ד/8` y))
                    EQUALS (`entitled to a pair of shoes and two coats` y AND `entitled to two coats` y))
            `every subject list checked of circular תשע"ד/8`
#ASSERT all (GIVEN t YIELD NOT elem t `the two-coats subjects of circular תשע"ד/8`) `the shoes-and-coats subjects of circular תשע"ד/8`

`a teacher on both technological lists meets two grants in circular תשע"ד/8` MEANS
    LET y MEANS `a checked year of circular תשע"ד/8` TRUE `the upper-division stage` (LIST 1) 10 FALSE 0 (LIST "מכטרוניקה", "מערכות אלקטרוניות")
    IN      `entitled to a pair of shoes and two coats` y
        AND `entitled to two coats` y
        AND NOT (`both grants added of circular תשע"ד/8` y EQUALS `technological clothing allowance of circular תשע"ד/8` y)
#ASSERT `a teacher on both technological lists meets two grants in circular תשע"ד/8`

-- F-2013-14_tashad_08-f: of the four sections, only 1 and 2 name the month
-- the allowance is paid in.
`the months sections 3 and 4 name for payment` MEANS EMPTY
`sections 3 and 4 name no month of payment` MEANS
    `the months sections 3 and 4 name for payment` EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `sections 3 and 4 name no month of payment`
